# Downloaded run artifacts. `wandb.Api().artifact.download()` defaults to ./artifacts,
# so querying a table from the repo root writes 30 HTML files with embedded frames into
# the working tree -- and a `git add -A` then commits them. It has happened once.
artifacts/
wandb/

# Run outputs and model weights. None of these belong in a repo, and a `git add -A`
# after an experiment is how they get here.
*.jsonl
*.pt
*.ckpt
*.safetensors
*.tar
checkpoints/
ray_results/
runs/
tensorboard/
nohup.out

